  "2026-10-24T09:41:59.524Z","harness:codex","Implementation scope: remove schema materialization from shared settings reads while retaining explicit init scaffolding. Prove absence and byte preservation across SDK and CLI reads, including refused reads, and preserve custom workflow loading. Related completed read-only fixes remain terminal; this is the independently reported missing-file delta."
  "2026-10-24T09:48:23.845Z","harness:codex","Regression evidence: the same isolated fixture failed before the fix because the first SDK get recreated workflows.json. Removing read-time scaffold from settings hydration preserves absence for get/list/context/search and refused get in SDK and CLI, plus existing schema bytes. Explicit init repairs missing workflow seeds, and reads tolerate a wholly absent optional schema directory. Cache, hook and malformed-schema tests are updated to assert pure reads and explicit owned fixture setup."
